<BaseLayout
  title={"Privacy Policy | Bleufoot Solutions"}
  description={"Read the Bleufoot Solutions privacy policy and learn how information submitted through our website is collected, used, and protected."}
  canonical={"https://www.bleufoot.com/privacy"}
  robots={"index, follow"}
  openGraph={{"title": "Privacy Policy | Bleufoot Solutions", "description": "Learn how Bleufoot Solutions collects, uses, and protects information submitted through its website.", "url": "https://www.bleufoot.com/privacy", "image": "https://www.bleufoot.com/assets/img/og-image.png"}}
  pageStylesheet={"/assets/css/privacy.css"}
>
<main>
<section class="page-hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="eyebrow">
<h4>Privacy</h4>
</div>
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>
          This policy explains how Bleufoot Solutions collects,
          uses, protects, and shares information obtained through
          this website.
        </p>
<p class="legal-updated">
          Last updated: July 20, 2026
        </p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section section-soft">
<div class="container">
<article class="card legal-content">
<h2>1. Who we are</h2>
<p>
            Bleufoot Solutions provides technology advisory,
            managed technology services, cybersecurity, cloud and
            infrastructure services, and network services for
            businesses in Austin and Central Texas.
          </p>
<p>
            Questions about this Privacy Policy may be sent to
            <a href="mailto:info@bleufoot.com">
              info@bleufoot.com
            </a>.
          </p>
<h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
<h3>Information you provide</h3>
<p>
            When you submit a contact, consultation, or quote
            request, we may collect:
          </p>
<ul>
<li>Your name</li>
<li>Your company or organization</li>
<li>Your email address</li>
<li>Your telephone number</li>
<li>The service in which you are interested</li>
<li>The message and other information you submit</li>
</ul>
<p>
            Please do not submit passwords, access credentials,
            payment information, confidential records, regulated
            data, or sensitive system information through the
            website forms.
          </p>
<h3>Information processed automatically</h3>
<p>
            When you use the website, hosting and security systems
            may process technical information such as your Internet
            Protocol address, browser type, device information,
            request date and time, requested pages, and security or
            diagnostic information.
          </p>
<p>
            This information may be used to operate the website,
            prevent abuse, investigate errors, maintain security,
            and understand website performance.
          </p>
<h2>3. How we use information</h2>
<p>
            Bleufoot Solutions may use collected information to:
          </p>
<ul>
<li>Respond to questions and service requests</li>
<li>Evaluate consulting, support, or project needs</li>
<li>Prepare estimates, proposals, or recommendations</li>
<li>Communicate about requested services</li>
<li>Operate, maintain, and secure the website</li>
<li>Detect spam, fraud, abuse, and technical problems</li>
<li>Maintain business and communication records</li>
<li>Comply with applicable legal obligations</li>
</ul>
<p>
            Submitting a website form does not automatically enroll
            you in a marketing mailing list.
          </p>
<h2>4. Service providers</h2>
<p>
            Bleufoot Solutions uses third-party service providers
            to operate and protect the website and process website
            requests.
          </p>
<h3>Cloudflare</h3>
<p>
            The website is hosted and protected using Cloudflare
            services. Cloudflare Turnstile is used on website forms
            to help distinguish legitimate visitors from automated
            submissions. Cloudflare may process browser, device,
            network, and security-related information when providing
            these services.
          </p>
<h3>Resend</h3>
<p>
            Resend is used to deliver messages submitted through the
            website forms to Bleufoot Solutions. Information included
            in a form submission may therefore be processed through
            Resend's email-delivery systems.
          </p>
<p>
            These providers maintain their own privacy, security,
            and data-processing practices.
          </p>
<h2>5. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
<p>
            Bleufoot Solutions does not use this website to sell
            behavioral advertising or intentionally create
            advertising profiles about visitors.
          </p>
<p>
            Cloudflare or other infrastructure providers may use
            cookies, browser storage, tokens, or similar technologies
            when necessary to provide security, prevent abuse,
            maintain network performance, or operate requested
            website functionality.
          </p>
<h2>6. How information may be shared</h2>
<p>
            Bleufoot Solutions does not sell personal information.
          </p>
<p>
            Information may be shared:
          </p>
<ul>
<li>
              With service providers that help operate the website,
              deliver email, prevent abuse, or provide business
              infrastructure
            </li>
<li>
              When reasonably necessary to respond to your request
              or provide requested services
            </li>
<li>
              When required by law, legal process, court order, or a
              valid government request
            </li>
<li>
              When reasonably necessary to protect Bleufoot
              Solutions, its clients, users, systems, property, or
              legal rights
            </li>
<li>
              In connection with a merger, acquisition, financing,
              reorganization, or transfer of business assets
            </li>
<li>With your direction or consent</li>
</ul>
<h2>7. Information retention</h2>
<p>
            Information is retained only for as long as reasonably
            necessary to respond to requests, maintain business
            records, support client relationships, resolve disputes,
            enforce agreements, protect systems, and comply with
            legal obligations.
          </p>
<p>
            Retention periods may vary depending on the nature of
            the request, whether a business relationship is formed,
            and applicable legal or operational requirements.
          </p>
<h2>8. Information security</h2>
<p>
            Bleufoot Solutions uses reasonable administrative,
            technical, and organizational measures intended to
            protect information against unauthorized access, loss,
            misuse, alteration, or disclosure.
          </p>
<p>
            No Internet transmission, email system, or electronic
            storage method can be guaranteed to be completely
            secure. Website forms should therefore not be used to
            transmit passwords, payment information, confidential
            records, or sensitive system details.
          </p>
<h2>9. Your choices and requests</h2>
<p>
            You may contact Bleufoot Solutions to request access to,
            correction of, or deletion of personal information you
            previously submitted through this website.
          </p>
<p>
            Requests may be sent to
            <a href="mailto:info@bleufoot.com">
              info@bleufoot.com
            </a>.
            We may need to verify your identity before completing a
            request. Certain information may be retained when
            required for legal, security, contractual, or legitimate
            business purposes.
          </p>
<h2>10. Children's privacy</h2>
<p>
            This website and Bleufoot Solutions' business services
            are intended for organizations and business
            professionals. The website is not directed to children,
            and Bleufoot Solutions does not knowingly request
            personal information from children through this site.
          </p>
<h2>11. Third-party websites</h2>
<p>
            This website may contain links to websites or services
            operated by third parties. Bleufoot Solutions is not
            responsible for the privacy, security, availability, or
            content practices of those third parties.
          </p>
<h2>12. Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>
            This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically to
            reflect changes in the website, services, technology, or
            legal requirements. The revised policy will be posted on
            this page with an updated revision date.
          </p>
<h2>13. Contact</h2>
<p>
            Questions, concerns, or privacy requests may be sent to:
          </p>
<p>
<strong>Bleufoot Solutions</strong><br/>
            Austin &amp; Central Texas<br/>
            Email:
            <a href="mailto:info@bleufoot.com">
              info@bleufoot.com
            </a><br/>
            Phone:
            <a href="tel:7372607072">
              737.260.7072
            </a>
</p>
</article>
</div>
</section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
